Subject: [PATCH] VBA: class events reach handlers, more of what real code compiles, Style by name

RaiseEvent passes its arguments, a property declared Any takes the value given,
ReDim of an object member, Optional defaults of Null and Office constants, New as
an argument, a call continued on the next line, dynamic arrays of differing
dimensions, and Series.Values keeps the cells.
